  "description": "Daphne Serenade Bukater, an ultra elite born with a silver spoon and dubbed Secradion’s Red Rose, remembers her past life and the tragic fate awaiting her. Reborn as the villainess of a popular novel, she knows how the story ends—with her death. To escape such a destiny, Daphne makes a bold choice—save Celestian, the brooding sub male lead destined for execution, and steer her life away from the path that leads to Romeo, the obsessive male lead and her former fiancé.\n\n(Source: Tapas)",
